          "text": "Skye owns the online clothing company Stealth & Glitter, and before that she spent about a decade in retail at Banana Republic, Gap and Victoria’s Secret. She dresses up even on ordinary days, so a pile of clothes here is a working wardrobe, and the same eye shows in the boutique across town.",
